{"title": "尼采哲学经典（套装共5册）", "index": 49, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body class=\"calibre\">\n<p class=\"calibre_\"><img class=\"calibre_39\" id=\"filepos378246\" src=\"images/00072.jpg\"/>\n</p><p class=\"calibre_11\"><span class=\"calibre3\">\n</span><span class=\"calibre3\"><span class=\"bold\">德国哲学家尼采（1844～1900）</span></span><span class=\"calibre3\">\n</span></p><p class=\"calibre_12\"><img class=\"calibre_40\" src=\"images/00004.jpg\"/>\n</p><p class=\"calibre_11\"><span class=\"calibre3\">\n</span><span class=\"calibre3\"><span class=\"bold\">尼采的签名</span></span><span class=\"calibre3\">\n</span></p><p class=\"calibre_12\"><img class=\"calibre_41\" src=\"images/00015.jpg\"/>\n</p><p class=\"calibre_11\"><span class=\"calibre3\">\n</span><span class=\"calibre3\"><span class=\"bold\">“三位一体”的友谊：莎乐美、保罗·李与尼采</span></span><span class=\"calibre3\">\n</span></p><p class=\"calibre_12\"><img class=\"calibre_29\" src=\"images/00084.jpg\"/>\n</p><p class=\"calibre_11\"><span class=\"calibre3\">\n</span><span class=\"calibre3\"><span class=\"bold\">尼采出生地洛肯镇牧师馆</span></span><span class=\"calibre3\">\n</span></p><p class=\"calibre4\" style=\"margin:0pt; border:0pt; height:1em\"> </p><table class=\"calibre_17\" valign=\"top\"><tr class=\"calibre_18\" valign=\"top\"><td class=\"calibre_19\"><img class=\"calibre_42\" src=\"images/00085.jpg\"/> </td><td class=\"calibre_19\"><img class=\"calibre_42\" src=\"images/00026.jpg\"/> </td></tr><tr class=\"calibre_18\" valign=\"top\"><td class=\"calibre_19\"><span class=\"calibre3\">   </span><span class=\"calibre3\"><span class=\"bold\">青年时代的尼采（1873年）  </span></span><span class=\"calibre3\">\n</span>\n</td><td class=\"calibre_19\"><span class=\"calibre3\">   </span><span class=\"calibre3\"><span class=\"bold\">任教巴塞尔大学时的尼采  </span></span><span class=\"calibre3\">\n</span>\n</td></tr><tr class=\"calibre_18\" valign=\"top\"><td class=\"calibre_19\"><img class=\"calibre_43\" src=\"images/00041.jpg\"/> </td><td class=\"calibre_19\"><img class=\"calibre_44\" src=\"images/00093.jpg\"/> </td></tr><tr class=\"calibre_18\" valign=\"top\"><td class=\"calibre_19\"><span class=\"calibre3\">   </span><span class=\"calibre3\"><span class=\"bold\">德国哲学家尼采（1844～1900）  </span></span><span class=\"calibre3\">\n</span>\n</td><td class=\"calibre_19\"><span class=\"calibre3\">   </span><span class=\"calibre3\"><span class=\"bold\">病床上看日落的尼采  </span></span><span class=\"calibre3\">\n</span>\n</td></tr></table><p class=\"calibre_2\"><img class=\"calibre_45\" src=\"images/00115.jpg\"/>\n</p><p class=\"calibre_11\"><span class=\"calibre3\">\n</span><span class=\"calibre3\"><span class=\"bold\">就读普福塔高等学校时的尼采（16岁）</span></span><span class=\"calibre3\">\n</span></p><p class=\"calibre4\" style=\"margin:0pt; border:0pt; height:1em\"> </p><table class=\"calibre_17\" valign=\"top\"><tr class=\"calibre_18\" valign=\"top\"><td class=\"calibre_19\"><img class=\"calibre_42\" src=\"images/00030.jpg\"/> </td><td class=\"calibre_19\"><img class=\"calibre_42\" src=\"images/00052.jpg\"/> </td></tr><tr class=\"calibre_18\" valign=\"top\"><td class=\"calibre_19\"><span class=\"calibre3\">   </span><span class=\"calibre3\"><span class=\"bold\">尼采曾就读的普福塔高等学校  </span></span><span class=\"calibre3\">\n</span>\n</td><td class=\"calibre_19\"><span class=\"calibre3\">   </span><span class=\"calibre3\"><span class=\"bold\">尼采的墓　德国莱比锡西南洛肯小镇教堂墓地  </span></span><span class=\"calibre3\">\n</span>\n</td></tr></table><p class=\"calibre_2\"><img class=\"calibre_46\" src=\"images/00102.jpg\"/>\n</p><p class=\"calibre_11\"><span class=\"calibre3\">\n</span><span class=\"calibre3\"><span class=\"bold\">尼采的女友莎乐美</span></span><span class=\"calibre3\">\n</span></p><p class=\"calibre_12\"><img class=\"calibre_47\" src=\"images/00077.jpg\"/>\n</p><p class=\"calibre_11\"><span class=\"calibre3\">\n</span><span class=\"calibre3\"><span class=\"bold\">魏玛的尼采档案馆</span></span><span class=\"calibre3\">\n</span></p><div class=\"mbp_pagebreak\" id=\"calibre_pb_48\"></div>\n</body>"}]}